  "date": "2026-11-26",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "蚂蚁国际在沙特的合资公司拿到电子货币牌照",
  "title_en": "Ant International's joint venture in Saudi Arabia gets an e-money licence",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "据移动支付网11月25日报道，蚂蚁国际和沙特邮政物流公司（SPL）一起成立的合资公司SPL ANT Saudi，已经得到沙特中央银行的批准，成为一家大型电子货币机构。",
      "en": "According to a Mpaypass report on November 25, SPL ANT Saudi, a joint venture set up by Ant International and Saudi Post and Logistics Services (SPL), has been approved by the Saudi Central Bank and has become a major electronic money institution."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这家公司打算用金融科技在沙特各地推广移动支付，并为当地的个人和企业提供数字金融服务。SPL在沙特全国有600多个线下网点，这些网点会帮助公司开展业务。",
      "en": "The company plans to use fintech to promote mobile payments across Saudi Arabia and to provide digital financial services to local individuals and businesses. SPL has more than 600 physical outlets across Saudi Arabia, and these outlets will help the company carry out its business."
    },
    {
      "zh": "公司表示，会遵守沙特央行的规定，保证服务质量，做到公开透明，并保护消费者。",
      "en": "The company said it will follow the Saudi central bank's rules, ensure the quality of its service, be open and transparent, and protect consumers."
    },
    {
      "zh": "两家公司在2025年签了战略合作协议。2025年2月，蚂蚁国际在沙特首都利雅得开了它在中东的第一个办公室。蚂蚁国际是蚂蚁集团的国际业务公司，主要做跨境支付等服务。",
      "en": "The two companies signed a strategic cooperation agreement in 2025. In February 2025, Ant International opened its first office in the Middle East in Riyadh, the Saudi capital. Ant International is Ant Group's international business company and mainly provides services such as cross-border payments."
    }
  ],
